WEBVTT

NOTE
Iguion gargoyle attack during the Deling City parade. Edea animates stone gargoyles on the ceremonial arch, which transform into living lizard creatures (Iguions) and chase Rinoa to the presidential residence rooftop.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A stone gargoyle crouches atop Deling City’s Triumphal Gate, while crowds gather far below.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The gargoyle's eye snaps open, crackling with magical energy.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A green lizard creature bursts from the crumbling stone shell, fully alive and snarling.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The Iguion tears free and leaps down from the Triumphal Gate toward the street below.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Two Iguions charge through the confused parade crowd.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Rinoa watches from the rooftop as the creatures leap straight toward her.
